&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Soho House, a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Recruitment Manager&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for collaborating with Global Head of Recruitment, to oversee new property openings and existing property hiring gaps, recruitment processes and partnerships. The Senior Recruitment Manager will work closely with General Managers to manage sourcing, interviewing, and employment processes and ensure that all Houses and properties are providing a positive candidate experience. Ultimately, the Recruitment Manager will support all recruitment to ensure Soho House is hiring the best and most qualified employees to maintain high Soho House standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiting for roles at all levels across our expanding portfolio of houses, restaurants and shared working spaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and reactive sourcing, screening and interviewing of candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching and guiding managers to ensure smooth and positive recruitment journey&lt;/li&gt;
